Let the client complete a value after var() substitution: a substitution
filter runs on each property and shorthand value once its variables are
substituted and before it is parsed, so math such as calc() over var() can be
resolved where the variables are known. The filter edits the value in place,
and no filter costs no copy.

diff --git a/Include/RmlUi/Core/StyleSheetSpecification.h b/Include/RmlUi/Core/StyleSheetSpecification.h
